=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# Note$
# Compare mode: each section shows the current pattern, as$
# hardn's components render it today (P-23, P-24; built), and$
# beside it or under it the proposed one (P-42): a mock after$
# Figma's rows, drawn by the gallery. No component changed.$
# Proposed: the subject at column 6 and its state, a coloured$
# word with no colon, in one column after it; notices as$
# callouts, neutral lines as muted prose.$
# Markers: Figma's status markers for a step done, failed or$
# rolled back, as here, in place of the key-value bullet, which$
# -marker bullet shows.$
# Status column: two cells after the widest title, as here; with$
# -column figma it is Figma's column 27, which these titles$
# reach, so their rows stack at every width.$
$
# compare failure ----------------------------------------------$
$
# Current ------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Done: Install hardn's boot unit$
  [+] Done: ufw: allow 2230/tcp$
  [+] Done: Add SSH port 2230$
  [!] Failed: Reload sshd (ssh.service) (COMMAND_FAILED)$
  [-] Skipped: sshd -T shows ports 22, 2230$
$
# Operation Failed$
# Reload sshd (ssh.service): reload: systemctl reload$
# ssh.service: host: systemctl reload ssh.service: exit status 1$
# (COMMAND_FAILED)$
$
  [<] Rolled back: Add SSH port 2230$
  [<] Rolled back: ufw: allow 2230/tcp$
$
      $ systemctl reload ssh.service$
      Job for ssh.service failed because the control process$
      | exited with error code.$
$
  [i] Info: Check the log file at /var/log/hardn.log for details$
$
# Proposed -----------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Install hardn's boot unit     Done$
  [+] ufw: allow 2230/tcp           Done$
  [+] Add SSH port 2230             Done$
  [ ] Reload sshd (ssh.service)     Failed COMMAND_FAILED$
   -  sshd -T shows ports 22, 2230  Skipped$
$
# Operation Failed$
# Reload sshd (ssh.service): reload: systemctl reload$
# ssh.service: host: systemctl reload ssh.service: exit status 1$
# (COMMAND_FAILED)$
$
  [ ] Add SSH port 2230             Rolled back$
  [ ] ufw: allow 2230/tcp           Rolled back$
$
      $ systemctl reload ssh.service$
      Job for ssh.service failed because the control process$
      | exited with error code.$
$
  Check the log file at /var/log/hardn.log for details$
$
$

